{"abstract":"On August 30, 1991, a notice of intent to prepare an environmental impact statement (EIS) for the Elk Wild and Scenic River Management Plan on the Siskiyou National Forest was published in the Federal Register (56 FR 42974). A notice of availability for the draft EIS was published in the Federal Register on November 20, 1992 (57 FR 54789), with a comment period on the draft EIS ending February 26, 1993. The Forest Service has decided to terminate the environmental analysis process. There will be no final EIS for the Elk Wild and Scenic River Management Plan.","action":"Cancellation of an environmental impact statement.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE","name":"Agriculture Department","id":12,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/agriculture-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/12","parent_id":null,"slug":"agriculture-department"},{"raw_name":"Forest Service","name":"Forest Service","id":209,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/forest-service","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/209","parent_id":12,"slug":"forest-service"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/1994/08/22/94-2050F.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":null,"comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":null,"disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Federal Register: August 22, 1994"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"94-2050F","effective_on":null,"end_page":0,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":null,"html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/1994/08/22/94-2050F/elk-wild-and-scenic-river-management-plan-siskiyou-national-forest-curry-county-or","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/94-2050F?publication_date=1994-08-22","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-1994-08-22/94-2050F/mods.xml","not_re